  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6502.13 User",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6502.13 “User” means the individual who is court- or department-ordered to install an ignition interlock device on any motor vehicle registered to that individual or used by that individual on a regular basis.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 6500) #13448, eff 9-20-22",
